    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming 3-Bed Cottage Style Residence set on 0.38 Hectares (0.94 Acres) \r\nAn exciting opportunity to acquire a charming Irish cottage with generous site, offering outstanding renovation and lifestyle potential. \r\n\r\nNestled in the countryside c.2.5km from Cavan town & less than c.5km from the prestigious Farnham Estate, Hotel, Spa & Golf Resort, this attractive three-bedroom detached cottage sits on approximately 0.38 hectares (0.94 acres), offering privacy, space, close proximity to all town services/amenities and endless possibilities for modernisation. \r\nWhether you're searching for a boutique home, countryside retreat, holiday property or investment opportunity, this property offers exceptional value with significant scope to create a beautiful rustic home full of character. \r\n\r\nSERVICES: \r\nESB connection \r\nMains Water connection\r\n\r\nExcellent refurbishment potential \r\n\tOpportunity to upgrade to an energy-efficient home \r\n\tAttractive renovation supports may be available to qualifying purchasers \r\n\tIdeal principal residence, holiday home or investment \r\n\tPotential eligibility for a range of  Government renovation supports (subject to purchaser qualification and scheme criteria). \r\n*All grants and financial supports are subject to applications, applicants, T&Cs etc. \r\n\r\n*Note: Grant eligibility depends on the buyer meeting the relevant scheme terms & conditions. Prospective purchasers should verify eligibility with the relevant local authority and SEAI before making financial decisions."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMODATION \r\n\r\nGround Floor \r\nLiving Room: 4.5m2 x 3.6m2 \r\nBedroom 1: 4.5m2 x 2.7m2 \r\n\r\nFirst Floor \r\nBedroom 2: 4.5m2 x 2.4m2 \r\nBedroom 3: 3m2 x 2.7m2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS\r\n\r\n•\tDetached 3-bedroom 2 storey cottage \r\n•\tC 0.38 hectares (0.94 acres)  private site \r\n•\tQuiet rural setting c.2,5km from Cavan town \r\n•\tServiced by Local Link transport \r\n•\tDoubled glazed windows & doors \r\n•\tExcellent renovation opportunity \r\n•\tIdeal home or holiday residence \r\n•\tConvenient access to nearby services and local amenities \r\n•\tPotential to substantially increase value through renovation/refurbishment \r\n•\tClose to Sports & Leisure facilities – Cavan Rugby Club, GAA Grounds & Farnham Estate Spa & Golf Resort etc. \r\n\r\nLIFESTYLE BENEFITS \r\nEnjoy all the benefits of country living: \r\n•\tPeaceful surroundings with a countryside feel \r\n•\tSpace for gardens or outdoor recreation \r\n•\tConvenient access to schools, shops and local services \r\n•\tEasy commuting distance to surrounding market towns"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the full potential of this charming countryside property.\r\nViewing by appointment with the auctioneers. Website: www.ortt.ie"
      }
